  "description": "A simple and lightweight implementation of a non-empty list in C#, inspired by Scala's List, that ensures a collection always has at least one item. This helps in reducing null-related bugs and ensures safe operations on collections with at least one element. Includes both mutable NonEmptyList and ImmutableNonEmptyList, functional programming operations (Map, FlatMap, Reduce, Fold, Zip), async extensions, and JSON serialization support.",
